  "text": "## Brand Principles\n\nEvery piece of content should communicate at least one of these:\n\n- Software should solve real business problems.\n- Automation saves time and money.\n- Technology should be simple to use.\n- Every business deserves scalable software.\n- Long-term quality is more important than quick delivery.\n\n---",
